<title>USA: Norman Hospital, Okla., yields 5.92 pct in 2021.</title>
<headline>Norman Hospital, Okla., yields 5.92 pct in 2021.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers said Wednesday it tentatively priced $35.6 million Norman Regional Hospital Authority, Okla., bonds at a top yield of 5.92 percent in 2021.</p>
<p>The preliminary pricing follows:  </p>
<p>NORMAN REGIONAL HOSPITAL AUTHORITY</p>
<p>RE: $35,570,000*</p>
<p>NORMAN, OKLAHOMA</p>
<p>    MOODY'S: Aaa		 S&amp;P: AAA</p>
<p>MBIA INSURED</p>
<p>    DATED: 11/01/1996	  FIRST COUPON: 03/01/1997</p>
<p>DUE: 09/01</p>
<p> MATURITY		AMOUNT*    COUPON	   PRICE</p>
<p>09/01/1997		1,140M    3.85  %	  3.85</p>
